<title>USA: Chiquita cuts stake in Smithfield.</title>
<headline>Chiquita cuts stake in Smithfield.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiquita Brands International Inc said Tuesday it cut its stake in Smithfield Foods Inc to 601,573 common shares or 3.3 percent of the outstanding from 6.2 percent disclosed in January.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 492,700 common shares between August 23 and September 9 at prices ranging from $27.69 to $29.59 per share.</p>
</text>
